---
// Shopify Explicit Payment Finite State Machine (FSM) Lifecycle Diagram Component
---

<figure class="spf-diag" aria-labelledby="spf-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="spf-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 160"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="spf-diag-title spf-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="spf-diag-title">Shopify 支付有限狀態機流轉圖</title>
    <desc id="spf-diag-desc">
      展示 Pending 經 Authorize 進入 Authorized，經 Capture 進入
      Captured，最終經 Refund 進入 Refunded 的嚴格單向流轉。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="spf-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="spf-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="spf-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="spf-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="spf-arrow-amber"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="spf-diag__arrow-head--amber"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="130"
      rx="12"
      class="spf-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- State 1: Pending (x: 45, width: 155) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 35)">
      <rect
        width="155"
        height="90"
        rx="8"
        class="spf-diag__box spf-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="77"
        y="32"
        class="spf-diag__title spf-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle">Pending</text
      >
      <text x="77" y="55" class="spf-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle"
        >初始化待處理</text
      >
      <text
        x="77"
        y="72"
        class="spf-diag__tag spf-diag__tag--blue"
        text-anchor="middle">建立扣款單</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1: Authorize -->
    <path
      d="M 200 80 L 260 80"
      class="spf-diag__path spf-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#spf-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <text x="230" y="70" class="spf-diag__edge-label" text-anchor="middle"
      >Authorize</text
    >

    <!-- State 2: Authorized (x: 265, width: 165) -->
    <g transform="translate(265, 35)">
      <rect
        width="165"
        height="90"
        rx="8"
        class="spf-diag__box spf-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="82"
        y="32"
        class="spf-diag__title spf-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle">Authorized</text
      >
      <text x="82" y="55" class="spf-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle"
        >額度凍結保留</text
      >
      <text
        x="82"
        y="72"
        class="spf-diag__tag spf-diag__tag--blue"
        text-anchor="middle">卡額度已預授權</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 2: Capture -->
    <path
      d="M 430 80 L 490 80"
      class="spf-diag__path spf-diag__path--green"
      marker-end="url(#spf-arrow-green)"></path>
    <text
      x="460"
      y="70"
      class="spf-diag__edge-label spf-diag__edge-label--green"
      text-anchor="middle">Capture</text
    >

    <!-- State 3: Captured (x: 495, width: 165) -->
    <g transform="translate(495, 35)">
      <rect
        width="165"
        height="90"
        rx="8"
        class="spf-diag__box spf-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="82"
        y="32"
        class="spf-diag__title spf-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle">Captured</text
      >
      <text x="82" y="55" class="spf-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle"
        >實扣款入帳成功</text
      >
      <text
        x="82"
        y="72"
        class="spf-diag__tag spf-diag__tag--green"
        text-anchor="middle">訂單履約發貨</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 3: Refund -->
    <path
      d="M 660 80 L 720 80"
      class="spf-diag__path spf-diag__path--amber"
      marker-end="url(#spf-arrow-amber)"></path>
    <text
      x="690"
      y="70"
      class="spf-diag__edge-label spf-diag__edge-label--amber"
      text-anchor="middle">Refund</text
    >

    <!-- State 4: Refunded (x: 725, width: 110) -->
    <g transform="translate(725, 35)">
      <rect
        width="110"
        height="90"
        rx="8"
        class="spf-diag__box spf-diag__box--amber"></rect>
      <text
        x="55"
        y="32"
        class="spf-diag__title spf-diag__title--amber"
        text-anchor="middle">Refunded</text
      >
      <text x="55" y="55" class="spf-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle"
        >款項原路退回</text
      >
      <text
        x="55"
        y="72"
        class="spf-diag__tag spf-diag__tag--amber"
        text-anchor="middle">沖正結案</text
      >
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="spf-diag__mobile">
    <div class="spf-mobile-card spf-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="spf-mobile-badge spf-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STATE 1: PENDING</span
      >
      <h4>1. 待處理 (Pending)</h4>
      <p>建立交易訂單與冪等鍵，準備發起授權請求。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-arrow">▼ 觸發 Authorize（預授權）</div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-card spf-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="spf-mobile-badge spf-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STATE 2: AUTHORIZED</span
      >
      <h4>2. 已授權 (Authorized)</h4>
      <p>發卡行成功鎖定用戶信用額度，商戶具備請款權利（通常保留 7 天）。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-arrow">▼ 觸發 Capture（扣款請款）</div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-card spf-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="spf-mobile-badge spf-mobile-badge--green"
        >STATE 3: CAPTURED</span
      >
      <h4>3. 已扣款 (Captured / Paid)</h4>
      <p>
        正式完成資金劃撥，商家確認收訖款項並安全觸發實體或虛擬履約物流發貨。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-arrow">▼ 觸發 Refund（退款沖正）</div>

    <div class="spf-mobile-card spf-mobile-card--amber">
      <span class="spf-mobile-badge spf-mobile-badge--amber"
        >STATE 4: REFUNDED</span
      >
      <h4>4. 已退款 (Refunded)</h4>
      <p>
        發生退貨或爭議款項時，透過原支付路徑全額或部分退還資金，終結 FSM
        狀態生命週期。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="spf-diag-caption" class="spf-diag__caption">
    圖一：Shopify 支付有限狀態機（FSM）單向嚴格流轉生命週期
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .spf-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .spf-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .spf-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .spf-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .spf-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .spf-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .spf-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .spf-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .spf-diag__box--amber {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #292316);
    stroke: #d29922;
  }

  .spf-diag__title {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .spf-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .spf-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .spf-diag__title--amber {
    fill: #e3b341;
  }

  .spf-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .spf-diag__tag {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .spf-diag__tag--blue {
    fill: #79c0ff;
  }

  .spf-diag__tag--green {
    fill: #56d364;
  }

  .spf-diag__tag--amber {
    fill: #f0883e;
  }

  .spf-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .spf-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .spf-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .spf-diag__path--amber {
    stroke: #d29922;
  }

  .spf-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #388bfd;
  }

  .spf-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #238636;
  }

  .spf-diag__arrow-head--amber {
    fill: #d29922;
  }

  .spf-diag__edge-label {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .spf-diag__edge-label--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .spf-diag__edge-label--amber {
    fill: #e3b341;
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__box--amber {
    fill: #fff8c5;
    stroke: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__title--amber {
    fill: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__path--amber {
    stroke: #9a6700;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .spf-diag__arrow-head--amber {
    fill: #9a6700;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .spf-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .spf-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .spf-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .spf-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .spf-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .spf-mobile-card--amber {
      border-color: #d29922;
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.05);
    }

    .spf-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .spf-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .spf-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .spf-mobile-badge--amber {
      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, 0.2);
      color: #e3b341;
    }

    .spf-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .spf-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }

    .spf-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
